    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nBarmoney, Ballyhogue is a most impressive dormer style home set on a fantastic site of approx 1.3 acres. Nicely set back from the roadway with mature trees for added privacy and large rear garden space with detached garage, this is one not to be overlooked. \n\nThe large inviting entrance hall feeds to living room, kitchen with dining room off to the rear, guest wc and downstairs bedroom. There is also a well designed sunroom and utility on the ground floor. The first floor offers a master suite with bedroom, walk in wardrobe and ensuite, two additional bedrooms and family bathroom all set off the open landing area which is light filled from overhead sky lights flooding the area in natural light.\nLocated just 6kms from Adamstown village offering, shop, petrol station, church, both primary and secondary school, while also just 15kms from Wexford town offering access to a wide variety of amenities. \n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.2m x 3.5m + 2.1m x 1.3m\nTiled floor, spotsand wall mounted lights, stairs to first floor\n\nLiving Room - 5.15m x 4.47m\nLaminate floor, feature wall with stove inset area and wood surround, wall mounted lights\n\nKitchen - 5.3m x 4.57m\nFitted waist and eye level kitchen units, fitted, Belfast style sink, tiled floor and splashback, plumbed for dishwasher, oven, hob and extractor fan, island unit, recessed lighting, open to dining room and sunroom\n\nDining Room - 3.8m x 3.77m\nTo rear, laminate floor\n\nSunroom - 4.4m x 3.7m\nLaminate floor, valuted ceiling with exposed timbers feature window, French doors to patio area\n\nUtility Room - 2.4m x 2.4m\nRear access point, fitted waist level units with stainless steel sink, plumbed for washing machine\n\nHotpress - 1.4m x 1.1m\nTiled floor, spots\n\nBedroom One/Gym - 3.77m x 3.67m\nLaminate floor, to the rear, tv point\n\nGuest WC - 2.32m x 2.06m\nFully tiled, WC, wash hand basin with vanity, shower corner unit with pump shower, extractor fan\n\nLanding - 5.1m x 1.15m\nLaminate floor, skylight, recessed lighting\n\nMaster Bedroom - 4.54m x 3.57m\nLaminate floor, two bay windows to front, attic access point\n\nEnsuite - 2.8m x 1.44m\nFully tiled, WC, wash hand basin with vanity, chrome towel radiator, Grohe rainfall shower, recessed lighting, extractor fan\n\nWalk in wardrobe - 1.63m x 1.2m\nLaminate floor, hanging, recessed lighting\n\nBedroom Three - 3.86m x 3.35m\nTo front, laminate floor\n\nWalk in wardrobe - 1.58m x 1.28m\nLaminate floor, recessed lighting\n\nBedroom Four - 4.1m x 3.7m\nLaminate floor, tv point\n\nBathroom - 4.45m x 1.94m (Bay Window 0.83m x 1.07m)\nJacuzzi bath, fully tiled, wash hand basin with vanity, mirror, corner shower unit with thermostatic shower, recessed lighting, Velux skylight\n\nOUTSIDE - \n\n\nPatio area - 7.88m x 4.3m\nGranite paving, covered area with chimney, drainage, external plugs, glass panel railings, ground level lighting\n\nGarage - 7m x 5.35m\nTwo roller doors to side, loft area with skylight, recessed lighting\n\nLoft - 6.35m x 5.35m\nVelux and windows to front, spots\n\n"
      },
